3. Todo App\par
Project Overview\par
TodoApp is a task management application designed to help users organize, track, and manage their daily tasks efficiently. Located at C:\\Users\\Admin\\Desktop\\Projects\\TodoApp, this project demonstrates modern application development practices with a focus on user experience and productivity.\par
