1. Technology Stack (Assumed based on common TodoApp implementations)\par
Frontend: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (or React/Vue.js)\par
Backend: Node.js with Express (or Python/Django)\par
Database: SQLite/PostgreSQL/MongoDB\par
Authentication: JWT or Session-based authentication\par
Deployment: Docker or traditional server deployment\par
2. Core Features\par
Task Management\par
Create Tasks: Users can add new tasks with titles, descriptions, and due dates\par
