12. Observations & Challenges\par
Challenges Faced:\par
1. Data Synchronization & Conflict Resolution\par
Challenge: When users access the TodoApp from multiple devices (desktop, mobile, tablet), keeping data consistent across all platforms becomes complex.\par
Explanation:\par
Real-time Updates: If a user marks a task as complete on their phone, the desktop version must reflect this change immediately\par
Offline Operations: Users may add/edit tasks without internet connection; these changes need to sync properly when back online\par
Conflict Scenarios:\par
User A marks "Buy groceries" as complete on Phone\par
User A edits "Buy groceries" to "Buy organic groceries" on Desktop\par
System must decide which change takes priority or merge them intelligently\par
2. User Authentication & Session Management\par
Challenge: Building a secure, seamless authentication system while maintaining good user experience.\par
Explanation:\par
Security vs. Convenience:\par
Long session times are convenient but pose security risks\par
Short sessions require frequent logins, annoying users\par
Token Management:\par
JWT tokens need proper expiration handling\par
Refresh tokens must be stored securely\par
Token theft prevention (CSRF, XSS attacks)\par
Password Management:\par
Forgot password functionality requires secure email integration\par
Password reset links must be time-limited and one-time use\par
Password strength requirements vs. user convenience\par
3. Performance Optimization with Large Datasets\par
Challenge: As users accumulate hundreds or thousands of tasks, the application becomes slow and unresponsive.\par
Explanation:\par
Rendering Issues:\par
Loading 5000 tasks at once causes browser freeze\par
DOM manipulation becomes expensive with many task items\par
Search Performance:\par
Searching through large datasets becomes slow\par
Real-time filtering while typing causes performance bottlenecks\par
Memory Management:\par
Each task object with subtasks, comments, attachments consumes memory\par
Browser tab crashes when memory usage exceeds limits\par
Network Efficiency:\par
Transferring large JSON payloads consumes bandwidth\par
Slow API responses on mobile networks\par
4. Cross-Browser & Responsive Design Issues\par
Challenge: Ensuring consistent appearance and functionality across different browsers, devices, and screen sizes.\par
Explanation:\par
Browser Inconsistencies:\par
Safari handles date inputs differently from Chrome\par
Firefox has different default button styles\par
Edge may interpret CSS flexbox differently\par
Device Fragmentation:\par
Mobile vs. Desktop touch/click events\par
Keyboard shortcuts on desktop vs. touch gestures on mobile\par
Different screen sizes require different layouts\par
Feature Support:\par
Modern CSS features may not work in older browsers\par
JavaScript APIs (like localStorage, Service Workers) may be unavailable\par
Third-party libraries may have compatibility issues\par
5. Data Privacy & Compliance (GDPR, CCPA)\par
Challenge: Meeting international data protection regulations while maintaining functionality.\par
Explanation:\par
Data Storage Requirements:\par
Must allow users to export all their data (Right to Access)\par
Must enable permanent deletion of user data (Right to Erasure)\par
Cannot store data longer than necessary\par
User Consent:\par
Need clear consent forms for data collection\par
Separate consent for different data types (personal info, usage analytics)\par
Easy opt-out mechanisms\par
Third-Party Integrations:\par
Analytics (Google Analytics) may violate privacy laws\par
Cookies require explicit consent\par
Data sharing with other services must be disclosed\par
Audit Trail:\par
Must log all data access and modifications\par
Need to prove compliance during audits\par
Documentation of security measures\par
Observations:\par
The project follows MVC architecture properly\par
Clear distinction between frontend and backend\par
Configuration files are properly isolated\par
Environment variables are used for sensitive data\par
Some complex functions have excellent documentation\par
Other areas lack comments entirely\par
JSDOC is used occasionally but not consistently\par
Smooth animations for task completion (0.3s transition)\par
Clear hover states on buttons\par
Loading spinners for async operations\par
Toast notifications for user feedback\par
Accessible colour contrast\par
